set key[id=11200105] guideDescription "\\n<font color='#7A7A7A'>An accessory you can get in the Illusion Dungeons \
    opened by rifts in time and space. A chaotic energy swirls around it as if the rift's power dwelt in it, and a \
    dangerous, mighty aura pours out of it.</font>"
