set key[id=13100328] tooltipDescription "<font color='#ff8ae5' size='14'>[Combat]\\nIncreases your gear score by \
    30000 in battlegrounds and arenas. Takes effect only with a Old Arena Dagger in each hand.</font>"
set key[id=13200323] tooltipDescription "<font color='#ff8ae5' size='14'>[Combat]\\nIncreases your gear score by \
    30000 in battlegrounds and arenas. Takes effect only when worn with the Old Arena Shield.</font>"
set key[id=13300322] tooltipDescription "<font color='#ff8ae5' size='14'>[Combat]\\nIncreases your gear score by \
    30000 in battlegrounds and arenas. Takes effect only when worn with the Old Arena Codex.</font>"
set key[id=13400321] tooltipDescription "<font color='#ff8ae5' size='14'>[Combat]\\nIncreases your gear score by \
    30000 in battlegrounds and arenas. Takes effect only with a Old Arena Throwing Star in each hand.</font>"
set key[id=14000267] guideDescription "\\n<font color='#7A7A7A'>Next-generation combat gear for the commanders of \
    the Tairen Kingdom, built by the AI Jessica to win the fight against Georg. Some of it is said to have been \
    stolen by an unknown group during prototype tests. This top-performance gear gets the most out of the ener \
    flow between weapon and armor, with far more attack and defense than the soldiers' Warrior set.</font>"
set key[id=14000268] guideDescription "\\n<font color='#7A7A7A'>Gear shaped after Infernog, made with the craft of \
    ancient Kritias, the unknown continent. Why gear in Infernog's image exists there is still a mystery. There \
    are only theories: that the ancients worshipped Infernog, or that they wanted to warn later ages of the \
    evil... As the essence of ancient Kritias's civilization, it wields great, heavy power.</font>"
set key[id=14000269] guideDescription "\\n<font color='#7A7A7A'>Gear you can get in the Illusion Dungeons opened \
    by rifts in time and space. A chaotic energy swirls around it as if the rift's power dwelt in it, and a \
    dangerous, mighty aura pours out of it.</font>"
set key[id=14100276] guideDescription "\\n<font color='#7A7A7A'>Next-generation combat gear for the commanders of \
    the Tairen Kingdom, built by the AI Jessica to win the fight against Georg. Some of it is said to have been \
    stolen by an unknown group during prototype tests. This top-performance gear gets the most out of the ener \
    flow between weapon and armor, with far more attack and defense than the soldiers' Warrior set.</font>"
