set key[id=20302952] tooltipDescription "A reward box from the PC Cafe perks, with a weapon and armor for your job \
    and shared accessories. Beginners get a job's weapon and armor at set odds instead, and cannot wear the \
    armor."
set key[id=20302952] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to get the items. The items you get \
    cannot be dismantled."
set key[id=20303094] tooltipDescription "A box pouring out chaotic energy and a mighty aura.\\nUse it to get 1 \
    Crystal Shine accessory."
set key[id=20303094] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to get the items.\\n\\n<font \
    color=\"#FF5F5F\">The gear you get is bound to your character, so use it with care.</font>"
set key[id=20303097] tooltipDescription "A box with a weapon for your job."
set key[id=20303097] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to get the items.\\n\\n<font \
    color=\"#FF5F5F\">The gear you get is bound to your character, so use it with care.</font>"
set key[id=20303098] tooltipDescription "A box that lets you choose a hat, gloves or shoes for your job."
set key[id=20303098] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to choose 1 of the items \
    inside.\\n\\n<font color=\"#FF5F5F\">The gear you get is bound to your character, so use it with care.</font>"
set key[id=20303181] tooltipDescription "An orb you get by defeating the monsters that appear where time and space \
    are warped. It shimmers mysteriously, as if the rift's power were packed inside, and a dangerous aura hangs \
    around it."
set key[id=20303181] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to get a boss's own gear at set odds."
set key[id=20303189] tooltipDescription "An orb you get by defeating the monsters that appear where time and space \
    are warped. It shimmers mysteriously, as if the rift's power were packed inside, and a dangerous aura hangs \
    around it."
set key[id=20303189] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to get a boss's own gear at set odds."
set key[id=20303235] tooltipDescription "A box with a +10 Fire Prism weapon for your job."
set key[id=20303235] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to get the items.\\n\\n<font \
    color=\"#FF5F5F\">* Everything in the box is bound to your character, and the gear's bonuses are rolled at set \
    odds when you open the box.</font>"
set key[id=20303236] tooltipDescription "A box of scrolls (weapon) with a mystic power that makes gear stronger."
set key[id=20303236] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to get the items.\\n\\n<font \
    color=\"#FF5F5F\">* Everything in the box is bound to your character, and the gear's bonuses are rolled at set \
    odds when you open the box.</font>"
set key[id=20303238] tooltipDescription "A package for Maple World heroes starting out, with a Fire Prism weapon, \
    Tairen Royal armor, Georg Kai accessories and more. Besides adventuring gear, it has items to power up, such \
    as pet fragments that make an Exceptional battle pet when combined and a mark choice box."
set key[id=20303238] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to get the items.\\n\\n<font \
    color=\"#FF5F5F\">* The gear, pet fragments and marks from the box are bound to your character, so use them \
    with care.\\n* The bonuses of gear from gear boxes are rolled at set odds when you open the box.</font>"
set key[id=20303242] tooltipDescription "A box of level 70 character-bound Georg Kai Legendary accessories. Use it \
    to get the earrings, cape, necklace, ring and belt."
set key[id=20303242] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to get the items.\\n\\n<font \
