set key[id=13100311] tooltipDescription "<font color='#ff8ae5' size='14'>[Ener Trigger]\\nPhysical/magic damage \
    increases by 8%, and when you hit while you have learned Poison Plan, your combat power increases by 2700 for \
    12 sec. The combat power effect cannot re-trigger within 10 sec. This effect only activates when the same gear \
    is worn in both hands and does not trigger on battlefields or in the arena.</font>"
set key[id=13100311] guideDescription "\\n<font color='#7A7A7A'>Next-generation combat gear for Tairen Kingdom \
    commanders. The AI Jessica developed it to win the fight against Georg. During prototype testing, part of it \
    is said to have been stolen by an unidentified organization. Ultra-high-performance gear that maximizes Ener \
    efficiency between weapons and armor. It boasts even stronger offense and defense than the soldier's Warrior \
    set.</font>"
set key[id=13100312] tooltipDescription "<font color='#ff8ae5' size='14'>[Power of the Ancients]\\nPhysical/magic \
    damage increases by 8%, and when you hit while in the Improvisation state, your combat power increases by 2700 \
    for 36 sec. The combat power effect cannot re-trigger within 10 sec. This effect only activates when the same \
    gear is worn in both hands and does not trigger on battlefields or in the arena.</font>"
set key[id=13100312] guideDescription "\\n<font color='#7A7A7A'>Gear modeled after Infernuk. The technology \
    applied to it comes from the ancient civilization of Critias. Critias, the unknown continent. Why gear modeled \
    after Infernuk exists there has never been revealed. There are only theories that the ancients worshiped \
    Infernuk, or that it was made to warn later generations of the existence of evil... This gear embodies the \
    ancient Critias civilization and delivers powerful, weighty force.</font>"
set key[id=13100313] tooltipDescription "<font color='#ff8ae5' size='14'>[Power of Phantom Spacetime]\\nWhen you \
    hit, there is a 10% chance that combat power increases by 5000, attack speed by 9% and accuracy by 9 for 15 \
    sec. This effect only activates when the same gear is worn in both hands and does not trigger on battlefields \
    or in the arena. In certain dungeons, the Power of Phantom Spacetime effect is doubled.</font>"
set key[id=13100313] guideDescription "<font color='#ff8ae5' size='14'>[Mysterious Enchant]\\nThe amount of \
    identical weapon materials needed for enchanting is greatly reduced, so you can enchant quickly.\\n[Limit \
    Break]\\nIf you enchant it to +15, you can break the limit through Lanemone.</font>\\n<font \
    color='#7A7A7A'>Gear obtainable in the Phantom Dungeon opened by the rift in spacetime. Chaotic energy swirls \
    around it as if the power of the rift dwells within, and a dangerous, powerful aura pours out of it.</font>"
