    $item:22004603$.\\nDouble-click it in your inventory to open the coin shop."
set key[id=30000597] tooltipDescription "A voucher you can exchange for NX. Be careful: if you break it down \
    before the NX is paid out, you may not receive it."
set key[id=30000597] guideDescription "NX payout date for 1st and 2nd round winners: Jul 17 (Fri) / 3rd and 4th \
    round winners: Jul 24 (Fri) / 5th and 6th round winners: Jul 31 (Fri) / 7th and 8th round winners: Aug 7 \
    (Fri)"
set key[id=30000857] tooltipDescription "A voucher you can exchange for NX. Be careful: if you discard it before \
    the NX is paid out, you may not receive it."
set key[id=30000857] guideDescription "NX payout date for 1st round winners: Dec 17 (Thu) / 2nd round winners: Dec \
    24 (Thu) / 3rd round winners: Dec 31 (Thu) / 4th round winners: Jan 7 (Thu) / 5th round winners: Jan 14 (Thu)"
set key[id=30000858] tooltipDescription "A coin with a mushroom on it, used to exchange for summer event prizes. \
    In $map:02000064$, take it to $npc:11001003$ to exchange it for various items."
set key[id=30000858] guideDescription "\\n How to get $item:30000858$<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n- Join the various \
    summer events in Maple World."
set key[id=30001053] mainDescription "<font size='14'>30 Min Cooldown | Lasts 30 Min</font>\\n<font \
    size='24'>Fishing EXP x2</font>"
set key[id=30001053] tooltipDescription "Double-click to use it. For 30 minutes, the EXP you gain from successful \
    catches is doubled. Only the most recently used EXP boost coupon takes effect. You can use it again after the \
    effect ends."
set key[id=30001103] tooltipDescription "An essence filled with the energy of fresh cherry blossoms.\\nNeeded to \
    upgrade the Cherry Blossom Box Key to the next level."
set key[id=30001103] guideDescription "\\nHow to get $item:30001103$<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n- Hunting, life \
    skills and clearing dungeons \\n- Clearing Ruby's daily quest \\n- Joining the 'Help Me! Dungeon' \
    event</font>"
set key[id=30001179] tooltipDescription "A kind of currency for playing the Mapleopoly game. Each ticket lets you \
    roll the dice once."
set key[id=30001179] guideDescription "\\nHow to get $item:30001179$<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n- 2 given when you \
    log in each day.\\n- 1 given after 20 minutes online. \\n- 1 given after 40 minutes online. \\n- 2 given after \
    60 minutes online.</font>"
set key[id=30001182] tooltipDescription "A delicate flower-shaped coin that holds the taste of sweet, lovely love. \
    It looks like a cupcake, but you can't eat it.\\nInstead, in $map:63000062$ you can exchange it for various \
    items at the shop of $npc:11004101$."
set key[id=30001182] guideDescription "\\nHow to get $item:30001182$<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n- Complete the Love \
    Dance Party (up to 3 times a day)\\n- In $map:63000062$ or $map:02000064$, accept and complete quests from \
    $npc:11001002$ and $npc:11001003$\\n- In $map:63000062$, complete the weekly quest of $npc:11004101$ for extra \
    coins\\n- Fishing and playing music have a chance to give extra coins</font>"
set key[id=30001190] tooltipDescription "A coin made to celebrate the Tria Starlight Festival.\\nYou can buy \
    various items from Bobby, the event helper in Queens Town."
set key[id=30001190] guideDescription "\\nHow to get $item:30001190$<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n- Join the Tria \
    Starlight Festival\\n- Open a Turnabout! Box to receive coins. \\n- Do Ruby's daily quest."
set key[id=30001207] tooltipDescription "A diary written in crooked, pressed-down handwriting. Lines like 'I'm \
    hungry...', 'I'm cold...' and 'I miss Daddy' stand out. "
set key[id=30001208] tooltipDescription "A license to practice as a lawyer in Maple World. Its field of specialty \
    reads 'Drafting and Executing Wills'."
set key[id=30001209] tooltipDescription "A transcribed copy made to back up the contents of a will. It says that \
    all of Count Monchou's property, including his hotel, goes to his daughter, and that she will be placed in her \
    adoptive father's care until she comes of age."
set key[id=30001210] tooltipDescription "It states that Flutino is adopting Marianne, Count Monchou's only \
    daughter, as his own. "
set key[id=30001211] tooltipDescription "A necklace that looks expensive. 'Mademoiselle Beaumarchais' is engraved \
    in tiny letters on the clasp."
set key[id=30001213] tooltipDescription "A will bearing Count Monchou's handwritten signature and official seal. \
    It says that all of his property, including his hotel, goes to his daughter, and that she will be placed in \
    her adoptive father's care until she comes of age."
set key[id=30001214] tooltipDescription "A pumpkin decoration that is a must for setting the Halloween mood."
set key[id=30001215] tooltipDescription "A beautiful rainbow fragment in bright, vivid colors. In $map:63000060$ \
    you can exchange it for various items at the shop of the event merchant $npc:11003558$."
set key[id=30001215] guideDescription "\\nHow to get $item:30001215$<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n- In $map:63000060$, \
    fish with $item:20000964$</font>\\n\\nUse the event map shortcut button to get to $map:63000060$ quickly and \
    easily."
set key[id=30001217] tooltipDescription "A coin modeled after fallen autumn maple leaves. \\nTake it to Bobby in \
    Queens Town to exchange it for items."
set key[id=30001217] guideDescription "\\nHow to get $item:30001217$<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n- Carry the \
    $item:20302065$ you receive by mail each day and fertilize the maple tree in Queens Town to get it through \
    $item:20302067$ \\n- Attendance rewards from Nov 11</font>"
set key[id=30001276] tooltipDescription "A coin made to celebrate the Starlight Festival.\\nYou can buy various \
    items from Bobby, the event helper at the Rainbow Fishing Spot."
set key[id=30001276] guideDescription "\\nHow to get $item:30001190$<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n- Join the Starlight \
    Festival"
set key[id=30001277] tooltipDescription "A coin modeled after the lucky pig that brings good fortune. \\nTake it \
    to Bobby in Queens Town or Babeni to exchange it for items."
set key[id=30001277] guideDescription "\\nHow to get $item:30001277$<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n- Cumulative rewards \
    from the Steaming Dumpling Festival\\n- Reward for the [Daily] Help the Baby Lucky Pig quest</font>"
set key[id=30001284] tooltipDescription "A coin issued to celebrate spring.\\nUse it to buy event goods from Bobby \
    in Queens Town and Babeni."
set key[id=30001284] guideDescription "\\nHow to get $item:30001284$<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n- Join the spring \
    events [Spring Seed Planting] and [Arwen's Glass Slippers]."
set key[id=30001287] tooltipDescription "A box of chocolates prepared with a fluttering heart for someone special. \
    \\nDouble-click it in Queens Town to set it up."
set key[id=30001287] guideDescription "\\nHow to join the event<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n- When you log in, you \
    receive a Valentine's Chocolate Box and Heart Sprinkles by mail.\\n- Double-click the chocolate box in Queens \
    Town to set it up.\\n- Another character decorates it with Heart Sprinkles. \\n- After 30 seconds the \
    chocolate is done, and you get 'Bittersweet Chocolate'.\\n- Get 30 during the event to earn the trophy and a \
    reward.</font>"
set key[id=30001288] tooltipDescription "A decor item that lets you become a chocolatier of love and decorate \
    chocolates.\\nWhen you find a Valentine's Chocolate Box in Queens Town, sprinkle it with decor."
set key[id=30001288] guideDescription "\\nHow to join the event<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n- When you log in, you \
    receive a Valentine's Chocolate Box and Heart Sprinkles by mail.\\n- Double-click the chocolate box in Queens \
    Town to set it up.\\n- Another character decorates it with Heart Sprinkles. \\n- After 30 seconds the \
    chocolate is done, and you get 'Bittersweet Chocolate'.\\n- Get 30 during the event to earn the trophy and a \
    reward.</font>"
set key[id=30001340] tooltipDescription "MC Kay's working papers. They seem to describe Kay's plans for an event."
set key[id=30001342] tooltipDescription "A coin filled with the lush green energy of spring.\\nIn $map:02000064$ \
    and $map:02020041$ you can exchange it for various items at the shop of $npc:11001003$."
set key[id=30001342] guideDescription "\\nHow to get $item:30001342$<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n- Green Guardian \
    attendance reward\\n- Reward for joining $map:51000004$\\n- Reward for joining $map:80000021$</font>"
set key[id=30001344] tooltipDescription "A Maple Coin used in the autumn event in Maple World.\nYou can exchange \
    it for various items with Bobby, the event helper in Queens Town or Babeni."
set key[id=30001344] guideDescription "\\nHow to get $item:30001344$<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n - Join the \
    Schwanda's Gallery event\\n - Win the Kay event\\n - Chance to get it when raising livestock, farming, \
    gathering or mining"
set key[id=30001381] tooltipDescription "A Maple Coin used in events in Maple World.\nYou can exchange it for \
    various items with Bobby, the event helper in Queens Town or Babeni."
set key[id=30001381] guideDescription "\\nHow to get $item:30001381$<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n - Join the \
    Schwanda's Gallery event\\n - Win the Kay event\\n - Chance to get it when raising livestock, farming, \
    gathering or mining"
set key[id=30001391] mainDescription "<font size='14'>3 Sec Cooldown</font>\\n<font size='24'>Instant EXP \
    gain</font>"
set key[id=30001391] tooltipDescription "A mysterious potion that instantly gives you a set amount of EXP."
set key[id=30001391] guideDescription "Drink it to gain 13,500,000 EXP right away."
set key[id=30001397] tooltipDescription "A coin you can get from the Bountiful Autumn Rock-Paper-Scissors event. \
    Use it at the Rock-Paper-Scissors Coin Shop."
set key[id=30001397] guideDescription "\\nHow to get $item:30001397$<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n- Join the Bountiful \
    Autumn Rock-Paper-Scissors event."
set key[id=30001398] tooltipDescription "A coin you can get from the Bountiful Autumn Rock-Paper-Scissors event. \
    Use it at the Rock-Paper-Scissors Coin Shop."
set key[id=30001398] guideDescription "\\nHow to get $item:30001398$<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n- Join the Bountiful \
    Autumn Rock-Paper-Scissors event."
set key[id=30001431] tooltipDescription "The base ingredient of the magic soup the witches brew in huge batches. \
    They say the thick juice of rotted pumpkin gives the witches' soup a rich, savory taste."
set key[id=30001431] guideDescription "\\nHow to get $item:30001431$<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n- Received by mail \
    after 30 minutes online each day</font>"
set key[id=30001433] tooltipDescription "$npc:50400341$'s favorite snack. You'll marvel at how $npc:50400341$ \
    gobbles it up, bones and all, in one smooth swallow."
set key[id=30001433] guideDescription "Carry this item and go near $item:50400341$ in your home to feed it. \
    \\n\\nHow to get $item:30001433$<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n- Received by mail each day for staying online 30 and \
    60 minutes\\n- Play with $npc:50400341$ in another player's home (up to 1 a day)</font>"
set key[id=30001434] tooltipDescription "A seed pouch prepared by Mani, the Alchemy Garden keeper, for the spring \
    event. It says 'Plant in southern Royal Road'."
set key[id=30001434] guideDescription "Use this item to receive the spring seed planting event quest."
set key[id=30001438] tooltipDescription "A toy $npcName:11003257$ loves dearly. But it hurts the cat's pride to \
    like a foxtail, so it hid the toy where nobody would find it. The soft, fluffy feel is delightful."
set key[id=30001439] tooltipDescription "A super-strong bug repellent made especially for $npc:11000015$, who \
    can't stand bugs. It works on large bug-type monsters as well as ordinary bugs. Only $npc:11003243$ knows the \
    original ingredients."
set key[id=30001440] tooltipDescription "A flame that $npcName:11000009$, who is afraid of the dark, was given by \
    kind-hearted $npcName:11000039$. It doesn't go out in strong winds or water, and its source is still unknown."
set key[id=30001445] tooltipDescription "'Help Me! Dungeon': a coin commemorating the mutual-aid campaign event \
    for building a warm Maple World where people help each other. In $map:02000064$ or $map:02000557$, take it to \
    $npc:11004243$ to exchange it for various items."
set key[id=30001445] guideDescription "\\nHow to get $item:30001410$<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n- Clearing Lv 70 \
    Adventure [Hard], Chaos Raid or Black Crusade  \\n- Both the veteran adventurer who helps a beginner and the \
    beginner who asked for help get it \\n- Up to 10 per day</font>"
set key[id=30001508] mainDescription "<font size='14'>Lasts 1 Min</font>\\n<font size='24'>Restores 384 HP per \
    sec</font>"
set key[id=30001508] tooltipDescription "A rare, precious herb. Its sweet scent is easy to fall for, but it tastes \
    bitter when you eat it."
set key[id=30001508] guideDescription "Eat it to restore 384 HP per second for 1 minute."
set key[id=30001518] tooltipDescription "A seed pouch prepared by Mani, the Alchemy Garden keeper, for the spring \
    event. It says 'Plant at Trinian Road'."
set key[id=30001518] guideDescription "Use this item to receive the spring seed planting event quest"
set key[id=30001519] tooltipDescription "A seed pouch prepared by Mani, the Alchemy Garden keeper, for the spring \
    event. It says 'Plant at the Baum Tree'."
set key[id=30001519] guideDescription "Use this item to receive the spring seed planting event quest"
set key[id=31002151] tooltipDescription "An option change voucher that re-rolls an item's stats."
set key[id=31002151] guideDescription "Double-click to use the option change voucher.\\n\\n<font \
    color=\"#FFFFFF\">Can only be used on Lv 50+ Epic daggers, longswords, wands, throwing stars, shields and \
    tomes. Only the bonus option values change.</font>\\n\\n<font color=\"#FF5F5F\">Changing options with an \
    option change voucher does not raise the bonus option change count.\\nItems with no bonus option, or that show \
    no bonus option change count, cannot be used.\\nThe same values may come up when you change options with a \
    voucher.</font>"
set key[id=31002152] tooltipDescription "An option change voucher that re-rolls an item's stats."
set key[id=31002152] guideDescription "Double-click to use the option change voucher.\\n\\n<font \
    color=\"#FFFFFF\">Can only be used on Lv 50+ Epic greatswords, bows, staffs, cannons, blades, knuckles and \
    orbs. Only the bonus option values change.</font>\\n\\n<font color=\"#FF5F5F\">Changing options with an option \
    change voucher does not raise the bonus option change count.\\nItems with no bonus option, or that show no \
    bonus option change count, cannot be used.\\nThe same values may come up when you change options with a \
    voucher.</font>"
set key[id=31002153] tooltipDescription "An option change voucher that re-rolls an item's stats."
set key[id=31002153] guideDescription "Double-click to use the option change voucher.\\n\\n<font \
    color=\"#FFFFFF\">Can only be used on Exceptional hats, tops, bottoms, overalls, gloves and shoes. Only the \
    bonus option values change.</font>\\n\\n<font color=\"#FF5F5F\">Changing options with an option change voucher \
    does not raise the bonus option change count.\\nItems with no bonus option, or that show no bonus option \
    change count, cannot be used.\\nThe same values may come up when you change options with a voucher.</font>"
set key[id=32000074] tooltipDescription "A small coin engraved with the face of mischievous Black Bean.\\nUse it \
    to buy various items at the event shop."
set key[id=32000074] guideDescription "\\nWhere to get $item:32000074$<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n- Black Bean \
    Balloon Release event</font>"
set key[id=34000072] tooltipDescription "A cello only adventurers who have diligently collected Treva Coins can \
    get. Its lifelike wings and finely engraved patterns have made it very popular."
set key[id=34000072] guideDescription "Double-click the item in your inventory to use it."
set key[id=34000100] tooltipDescription "A fretless bass made by Arian Music Company. It gives a different feel \
    from an ordinary bass guitar."
set key[id=34000100] guideDescription "Double-click the item in your inventory to use it. You can play up to 3 \
    solo scores in a row at the same time."
set key[id=34000101] tooltipDescription "A marimba made by Arian Music Company. It looks like a xylophone, but its \
    sound is clearer and deeper."
set key[id=34000101] guideDescription "Double-click the item in your inventory to use it. You can play up to 3 \
    solo scores in a row at the same time."
set key[id=34000103] tooltipDescription "A flute made by Arian Music Company. Its high, clear tone is charming and \
    stands out in any performance."
set key[id=34000103] guideDescription "Double-click the item in your inventory to use it. You can play up to 3 \
    solo scores in a row at the same time."
set key[id=34000104] tooltipDescription "An electric piano full of summer atmosphere. Watching the parrot chirp \
    along to the music takes the edge off the heat."
set key[id=34000104] guideDescription "Double-click the item in your inventory to use it. You can play up to 3 \
    solo scores in a row at the same time."
set key[id=34000105] tooltipDescription "A steel drum full of summer atmosphere. It would suit a performance on \
    the beach."
set key[id=34000105] guideDescription "Double-click the item in your inventory to use it. You can play up to 3 \
    solo scores in a row at the same time."
set key[id=34000106] tooltipDescription "An oboe only adventurers who have diligently collected Treva Coins can \
    get. Its cool look, reminiscent of a small dragon, makes it a must-play for any oboist."
set key[id=34000106] guideDescription "Double-click the item in your inventory to use it."
set key[id=34000107] tooltipDescription "A violin only adventurers who have diligently collected Treva Coins can \
    get. It can only be played pizzicato. Quite a few people have fallen for its blood-red body and ornate \
    patterns."
set key[id=34000107] guideDescription "Double-click the item in your inventory to use it."
set key[id=34000108] tooltipDescription "A piano only adventurers who have diligently collected Treva Coins can \
    get. Its antique design, dripping candles and the bats circling around give it an eerie air."
set key[id=34000108] guideDescription "Double-click the item in your inventory to use it."
set key[id=34000109] tooltipDescription "A piano full of mysterious oriental charm. The beautiful melody drifting \
    out among its dazzling decorations is very romantic."
set key[id=34000109] guideDescription "Double-click the item in your inventory to use it. You can play up to 3 \
    solo scores in a row at the same time."
set key[id=34000110] tooltipDescription "A violin full of mysterious oriental charm. The sparkling melody blooming \
    from your fingertips creates a golden romance."
set key[id=34000110] guideDescription "Double-click the item in your inventory to use it. You can play up to 3 \
    solo scores in a row at the same time."
set key[id=36000608] tooltipDescription "A fragment you get by breaking down Crystal Shine hat, glove and shoe \
    armor."
set key[id=36000608] guideDescription "Double-click to use it. Spend 20 to make $item:20303251$."
set key[id=36000609] tooltipDescription "A fragment you get by breaking down Crystal Shine top and bottom armor."
set key[id=36000609] guideDescription "Double-click to use it. Spend 20 to make $item:20303252$."
set key[id=36000610] tooltipDescription "A fragment of $item:11200107$."
set key[id=36000610] guideDescription "Double-click to use it. Spend 16 to make $item:11200107$."
set key[id=36000611] tooltipDescription "A fragment of $item:11800151$."
set key[id=36000611] guideDescription "Double-click to use it. Spend 16 to make $item:11800151$."
set key[id=36000612] tooltipDescription "A fragment of $item:11900129$."
set key[id=36000612] guideDescription "Double-click to use it. Spend 16 to make $item:11900129$."
set key[id=36000613] tooltipDescription "A fragment of $item:12000118$."
set key[id=36000613] guideDescription "Double-click to use it. Spend 16 to make $item:12000118$."
set key[id=36000614] tooltipDescription "A fragment of $item:12100119$."
set key[id=36000614] guideDescription "Double-click to use it. Spend 16 to make $item:12100119$."
set key[id=36000616] tooltipDescription "A fragment ablaze with Blue Rook's mysterious blue flames. If you gather \
    enough of them, you may be able to harness the power of the blue flames."
set key[id=36000616] guideDescription "Double-click to use it. Spend 165 to make $item:12100122$."
set key[id=36000617] tooltipDescription "A fragment you can get from $dungeonTitle:23110001$."
set key[id=36000617] guideDescription "Double-click to use it. Spend 48 to make $item:20303111$."
set key[id=36000618] tooltipDescription "A fragment you can get from $dungeonTitle:23110001$."
set key[id=36000618] guideDescription "Double-click to use it. Spend 48 to make $item:20303112$."
set key[id=36000619] tooltipDescription "A fragment you can get from $dungeonTitle:23110001$."
set key[id=36000619] guideDescription "Double-click to use it. Spend 48 to make $item:20303118$."
set key[id=40100021] tooltipDescription "A rare gem that gives off a warm green glow. You can get it from field \
    bosses and golden treasure chests."
set key[id=40100021] guideDescription "Used to change the bonus options of equipment and to combine Lapenshards."
set key[id=40100034] tooltipDescription "A rare gem that gives off a warm green glow. You can get it from field \
    bosses and golden treasure chests."
set key[id=40100034] guideDescription "Used to change the bonus options of equipment and to combine Lapenshards."
set key[id=40100055] tooltipDescription "A strange crystal found in the realm of illusions beyond the rift in time \
    and space. It first appeared in Maple World, and the power of the rift gives it strong energy. Applying it to \
    a Fire Prism weapon from the Illusion Dungeon creates tremendous synergy."
set key[id=40100055] guideDescription "A material needed for limit breaking. It lets you push a weapon past its \
    limits and raise its performance."
set key[id=40100056] tooltipDescription "A strange crystal found in the realm of illusions beyond the rift in time \
    and space. It first appeared in Maple World, and the power of the rift gives it strong energy. Applying it to \
    a Fire Prism weapon from the Illusion Dungeon creates tremendous synergy."
set key[id=40100056] guideDescription "A material needed for limit breaking. It lets you push a weapon past its \
    limits and raise its performance."
set key[id=40100062] tooltipDescription "A crystal that sparkles like a jewel. You can get it by breaking down \
    certain outfits."
set key[id=40100062] guideDescription "A material needed to open locked outfit sockets or to upgrade Lumistones."
set key[id=40100063] tooltipDescription "A smooth gem with a black sheen. You can get it by breaking down \
    equipment items."
set key[id=40100063] guideDescription "A material used to enchant equipment. It raises the strength, durability \
    and power of equipment to the maximum."
set key[id=40100064] tooltipDescription "A gem of many colors, a transformed onyx. Its clear glow is unstable but \
    carries a special power. You can get it by breaking down Exceptional or higher equipment items."
set key[id=40100064] guideDescription "A material used to enchant equipment. Along with Onyx Crystals, it raises \
    the strength, durability and power of equipment to the maximum."
set key[id=40400055] mainDescription "Summons Pink Bean Mini Car Ride"
set key[id=40400055] tooltipDescription "A mini car modeled after pink idol Pink Bean. Its tiny feet and tail \
    never stop moving, and it is almost too cute to bear. The Pink Bean Mini Car Ride rises 0.5m per second, up to \
    4m. While active, press a direction key to move forward 7m at a time. Cannot be used indoors or in some \
    areas."
set key[id=40400055] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory or register it in a quick slot to get on \
    and off."
set key[id=40400061] mainDescription "Summons Rainbow Cloud"
set key[id=40400061] tooltipDescription "A colorful rainbow cloud. On the Rainbow Cloud you rise 1.2m per second, \
    up to 12m. While moving, you fly forward 6.5m per second. Cannot be used indoors or in some areas."
set key[id=40400061] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory or register it in a quick slot to get on \
    and off."
set key[id=40400078] mainDescription "Summons Surfboard"
set key[id=40400078] tooltipDescription "A thrilling surfboard for riding cool waves. On the Surfboard you rise \
    0.5m per second, up to 13m. While moving, you accelerate 2m per second, up to 6.5m ahead. Cannot be used \
    indoors or in some areas."
set key[id=40400078] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory or register it in a quick slot to get on \
    and off."
set key[id=40400080] mainDescription "Summons Spinning Whirlwind House"
set key[id=40400080] tooltipDescription "You rise 0.5m per second, up to 4m, with the Spinning Whirlwind House. \
    While active, press a direction key to move forward 6.5m at a time.  Cannot be used indoors or in some areas."
set key[id=40400080] guideDescription "\\nDouble-click it in your inventory or register it in a quick slot to get \
    on and off.\n\\n * Where to get it<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n- Winter Rock-Paper-Scissors event</font>"
set key[id=40400092] mainDescription "Summons Cherry Pink Plum Fan"
set key[id=40400092] tooltipDescription "Fly through the sky on the Cherry Pink Plum Fan. On the plum fan you rise \
    0.5m per second, up to 4m. While active, press a direction key to move forward 7m at a time.  Cannot be used \
    indoors or in some areas."
set key[id=40400092] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory or register it in a quick slot to get on \
    and off."
set key[id=40400093] mainDescription "Summons Flying Sunfish"
set key[id=40400093] tooltipDescription "A sunfish that swims through the sky as if it were the sea. On the \
    sunfish you rise 0.5m per second, up to 4m. While active, press a direction key to move forward 7m at a \
    time.  Cannot be used indoors or in some areas."
set key[id=40400093] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory or register it in a quick slot to get on \
    and off."
set key[id=40400115] mainDescription "Summons Shining Unicorn"
set key[id=40400115] tooltipDescription "A legendary unicorn said to be tamed only by those with a beautiful \
