    who made headlines in Maple World, and suggests recalling the past year while going to meet people. \nIn \
    $map:02000146$, meet $npc:11000076$, the handsome man carrying out Empress $npcName:11000075$'s orders, and \
    pass on $npc:11001002$'s regards.\n"
set quest[questID=80000064] complete "Talk to $npc:11001002$ in $map:02000064$ or $map:63000032$"
