    who made headlines in Maple World, and suggests recalling the past year while going to meet people. \nGo to \
    $map:02010047$ to meet $npc:11001430$, a mysterious pretty boy with a kind face but a cold way of speaking."
set quest[questID=80000073] complete "Talk to $npc:11001002$ in $map:02000064$ or $map:63000032$"
