    night!\n$npc:11001002$ suggests finding a lucky person who radiates charm to others and spreading love far and \
    wide.\nToday's Lucky Guy: a female Knight of level 20 or higher. Go find her."
set quest[questID=80000509] manual "Find a female Knight of level 20 or higher"
set quest[questID=80000509] complete "Talk to $npc:11001002$ in $map:02000064$ or $map:63000062$"
