set key[id=1106192207015583] name "I'll end it."
set key[id=1106192207015584] name "I'll think about it."
set key[id=1106192207015585] name "Understood. Once your partner agrees, I'll help you end the wedding completely \
    and say your farewells to the guests."
set key[id=1106192207015586] name "All right.\nEnjoy the wedding a bit more, and come find me again when you need \
    me."
set key[id=1106192207015587] name "$MyPCName$. Shall we begin the wedding?"
set key[id=1106192207015588] name "I'd like to start the wedding."
set key[id=1106192207015589] name "Very well. As soon as your partner agrees, we'll begin the wedding."
set key[id=1106192207015590] name "That was a fine wedding, $MyPCName$. What a good-looking pair!\nWhat do you \
    plan to do from here? Tell me if you want to end the wedding."
set key[id=1106192207015591] name "I'd like to end the wedding."
set key[id=1106192207015592] name "We still have the commemorative photos and the after party."
set key[id=1106192207015593] name "When you end the wedding, the couple and all the guests will leave the wedding \
    hall.\nIf there are after-events you haven't done yet, or you'd like to enjoy the wedding a bit more, it's \
    best not to request the ending yet.\nOnce I end the wedding, it can't be undone."
set key[id=1106192207015594] name "Well, what will it be? Shall we end the wedding?"
set key[id=1106192207015595] name "I'll end it."
set key[id=1106192207015596] name "I'll think about it."
set key[id=1106192207015597] name "Understood. Once your partner agrees, I'll end the wedding for you.\nNow, be \
    happy!"
set key[id=1106192207015598] name "Very well. Enjoy the wedding a bit more, and tell me when you need me."
set key[id=1106192207015599] name "We still have the commemorative photos and the after party."
set key[id=1106192207015600] name "$MyPCName$. Are you ready to begin the wedding?"
set key[id=1106192207015601] name "I'd like to start the wedding."
set key[id=1106192207015602] name "Understood. Once your partner agrees, we'll begin the wedding right away."
set key[id=1106192207015603] name "That was a truly wonderful wedding, $MyPCName$. I bless you both, such \
    beautiful people.\nDo you want to end the wedding? Or are you thinking of enjoying the after-events a little \
    more?"
set key[id=1106192207015604] name "I'd like to end the wedding."
set key[id=1106192207015605] name "We still have the commemorative photos and the after party."
set key[id=1106192207015606] name "When you end the wedding, the couple and all the guests will leave the wedding \
    hall.\nIf there are after-events you haven't done yet, or you'd like to enjoy the wedding a bit more, it would \
    be best not to request the ending yet.\nOnce I end the wedding, it can't be undone."
set key[id=1106192207015607] name "If you truly want to end it, I'll finish the wedding once your partner agrees. \
    Is that what you want?"
set key[id=1106192207015608] name "I'll end it."
set key[id=1106192207015609] name "I'll think about it."
set key[id=1106192207015610] name "Understood. Once your partner agrees, I'll help you end the wedding completely \
    and say your farewells to the guests."
set key[id=1106192207015611] name "Very well. It's a good day, so soak up plenty of the sacred energy of \
    $map:84000014$.\nTake your time and enjoy yourselves, and come find me again when you need me."
set key[id=1106192207015612] name "It's truly beautiful."
set key[id=1106201207015628] name "Nice to see you, $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=1106201207015629] name "Nice to see you, $MyPCName$. Do you need my help?"
set key[id=1106201207015630] name "Nice to see you, $MyPCName$. Do you need my help?"
set key[id=1106201207015631] name "I want to get married."
set key[id=1106201207015632] name "How do I reserve a wedding hall?"
set key[id=1106201207015633] name "Yes, marriage is a good thing. You should do it!\nWhen you have someone you've \
    promised to marry, I'll help you reserve a wonderful wedding."
set key[id=1106201207015634] name "How do I get married?"
set key[id=1106201207015635] name "I want to marry you."
set key[id=1106201207015636] name "To get married, you first have to propose to a friend and become engaged.\nThen \
    meet a Wedding Planner, reserve a wedding hall, and hold your wedding.\nAn engagement only lasts 7 days. If \
    you don't hold the wedding within that time, the engagement disappears, so be careful."
set key[id=1106201207015637] name "When you reserve a wedding hall, and again when you complete the wedding, we \
    send a reservation gift and a wedding gift by mail.\nThese gifts differ depending on the wedding hall, so \
    please choose carefully when you reserve."
set key[id=1106201207015638] name "Huh? Wh... What??? M... Me???\nI... I can't. I have a lot of work to do... "
set key[id=1106201207015639] name "I appreciate the thought, but I'll pretend I didn't hear that!\nWhen you find \
    someone you truly want to marry, I'll work really hard to help with your wedding reservation! That I can \
    promise! "
set key[id=1106201207015640] name "You can reserve a wedding hall through the wedding planners.\nJust talk to a \
    wedding planner, reserve a hall, and pay the reservation fee.\nIf you want details, why not try making a \
    reservation yourself? "
set key[id=1106201207015641] name "Oh, and each wedding planner has a slightly different specialty and different \
    recommendations.\nIt's a good idea to consult the wedding planners before you make a reservation. "
set key[id=1106201207015642] name "Could you recommend a wedding hall?"
set key[id=1106201207015643] name "The wedding halls I recommend are two: $map:84000011$, loved by everyone,\nand \
    the simple and beautiful $map:84000012$.\nIf you'd like to see them ahead of time, please come back after you \
    get engaged.\nWe offer engaged couples a chance at a preview tour. "
set key[id=1106201207015644] name "Nice to see you, $MyPCName$. Do you need my help?"
set key[id=1106201207015645] name "I'd like to reserve a wedding hall."
set key[id=1106201207015646] name "I'd like to take the recommended wedding hall tour."
set key[id=1106201207015647] name "I'm glad you came. I'll help you make a reservation right away."
set key[id=1106201207015648] name "The recommended wedding hall tour is a service that shows you the halls the \
    wedding planner recommends in advance.\nIt's only for getting a feel for them, so please note that you can \
    only take a quick look around at a set spot~"
set key[id=1106201207015649] name "The wedding halls I recommend are two: $map:84000011$, loved by everyone,\nand \
    the simple and beautiful $map:84000012$. "
set key[id=1106201207015650] name "I'd like to go see $map:84000011$."
set key[id=1106201207015651] name "I'd like to go see $map:84000012$."
set key[id=1106201207015652] name "Understood.\nThey look different by day and night... Which would you like to \
    visit? "
set key[id=1106201207015653] name "I'd like to go see $map:84000011$ in the daytime."
set key[id=1106201207015654] name "I'd like to go see $map:84000011$ at night."
set key[id=1106201207015655] name "Okay, I'll take you there now."
set key[id=1106201207015656] name "Okay, I'll take you there now."
set key[id=1106201207015657] name "Understood.\nThey look different by day and night... Which would you like to \
    visit? "
set key[id=1106201207015658] name "I'd like to go see $map:84000012$ in the daytime."
set key[id=1106201207015659] name "I'd like to go see $map:84000012$ at night."
set key[id=1106201207015660] name "Okay, I'll take you there now."
set key[id=1106201207015661] name "Okay, I'll take you there now."
set key[id=1106201207015662] name "Nice to see you, $MyPCName$.\nAre you enjoying married life?"
set key[id=1106201207015663] name "I'm happy."
set key[id=1106201207015665] name "I'm glad you came. I'll help you make a reservation right away."
set key[id=1106201207015666] name "Nice to see you, $MyPCName$. Do you need my help?"
set key[id=1106201207015667] name "I'd like to renew our vows."
set key[id=1106201207015668] name "$MyPCName$, you can only hold a vow renewal once at least 30 days have passed \
    since your wedding.\nYou can't go ahead just yet, so please come back after a little more time has passed. "
set key[id=1106201207015669] name "Nice to see you, $MyPCName$. Do you need help?"
set key[id=1106201207015670] name "I'd like to change my wedding hall reservation."
set key[id=1106201207015672] name "Understood. Then I'll help you change your reservation right away.\nYour \
    partner has to come here and agree to it too before it can be changed, so be sure to call them over. "
set key[id=1106201207015673] name "Okay, first check the reservation info and make your final decision.\nIf your \
    partner agrees to cancel the reservation, we'll give you a <font color=\"#ffd200\">free reservation coupon for \
    a wedding hall of the same grade</font> later. The coupon is valid for 30 days after you get it, so be sure to \
    use it within that time.\nIf your partner doesn't agree, you won't receive the free reservation coupon."
set key[id=1106201207015674] name "Nice to see you, $MyPCName$. Do you need my help?"
set key[id=1106201207015675] name "I want to get married."
set key[id=1106201207015676] name "Hmm... It looks like you went through a divorce not long ago...\nIt seems too \
    early for you to marry again.\nLet's meet again after a bit more time has passed, when you've found someone \
    new."
set key[id=1106201207015677] name "Nice to see you, $MyPCName$. Do you need help?"
set key[id=1106201207015678] name "I'd like to change my wedding hall reservation."
set key[id=1106201207015680] name "Understood.\nThen I'll help you change your reservation right away. "
set key[id=1106201207015681] name "Okay, first check the reservation info and make your final decision.\nIf your \
    partner agrees to cancel the reservation, we'll give you a <font color=\"#ffd200\">free reservation coupon for \
    a wedding hall of the same grade</font> later. The coupon is valid for 30 days after you get it, so be sure to \
    use it within that time.\nIf your partner doesn't agree, you won't receive the free reservation coupon."
set key[id=1106210607015682] name "If you've reserved a wedding hall, try sending out invitations! I'll help you! \
    "
set key[id=1106210607015683] name "Once you reserve a wedding hall, you can send invitations.\nThere is a fee of \
    1,000 mesos per invitation sent.\nIt covers the cost of delivering your happy news, so please bear with us."
set key[id=1106210807015682] name "So you've reserved a wedding. Would you like to send invitations?"
set key[id=1106210807015683] name "I'll send out the invitations."
set key[id=1106210807015684] name "There is a fee of 1,000 mesos per invitation sent, and even with an invitation, \
    you can't enter if the wedding hall has reached its maximum capacity.\nChoose who will receive an invitation, \
    then press Send."
set key[id=1106210807015685] name "Having a wedding? Send out invitations!"
set key[id=1106210807015686] name "Wedding news is best when it's shared! "
set key[id=1106210807015687] name "Please send your invitations!"
set key[id=1106210807015688] name "Once you've reserved a wedding hall, you can send invitations!\nJust use the \
    red mailbox next to me!"
set key[id=1106210807015689] name "Tell me more about sending invitations."
set key[id=1106210807015690] name "There is a fee of 1,000 mesos per invitation sent.\nIt covers the cost of \
    delivering your happy news, so please bear with us!"
set key[id=1106210807015691] name "When you send invitations, the people around you will learn the date and place \
    of your wedding.\nWhen it's time for the wedding, those who received an invitation get a wedding entry \
    notice,\nand they can click it to enter the wedding hall with ease."
set key[id=1106210807015692] name "But not everyone who gets an invitation can enter the wedding hall.\nIf the \
    wedding hall's maximum capacity is exceeded, they won't be able to get in.\nPlease be sure to keep that in \
    mind."
set key[id=1106210807015693] name "But don't be disappointed. Once you've sent an invitation, we'll also send them \
    a mail if the wedding reservation time is changed or canceled.\nIf you want a wedding shared with the people \
    around you, make use of invitations! "
set key[id=1108092907015695] name "An uncontested divorce can only be processed when a couple who have been \
    married for 31 days or more come to $map:84000002$ together and both agree."
set key[id=1108094307015696] name "To apply for a forced divorce, you must have been married for 31 days or more \
    and pay the divorce fee of 1,000,000 mesos.\n$MyPCName$, you don't meet the conditions, so you can't apply for \
    a forced divorce."
set key[id=1108095607015697] name "I'm $npcName:11004713[gender:0]$, a lawyer at $map:84000002$. Do you need \
    something from me?"
set key[id=1108095607015698] name "I wonder how the forced divorce application is going."
set key[id=1108095607015699] name "Your partner hasn't stated their wishes about the forced divorce \
    application.\nThe divorce reconsideration period is still in progress, so please wait."
set key[id=1108095807015700] name "I'm $npcName:11004713[gender:0]$, a lawyer at $map:84000002$. Do you need \
    something from me?"
set key[id=1108095807015701] name "I wonder how the forced divorce application is going."
set key[id=1108195507015703] name "Would you perhaps like to cancel your forced divorce application?\nI can \
    process that if you wish. However, the fee will not be refunded."
set key[id=1108195507015704] name "I'd like to cancel the forced divorce application."
set key[id=1108195507015705] name "I'll think about it again."
set key[id=1108195507015706] name "Understood.\nOnce the cancellation is complete, a confirmation mail will \
    arrive, so please check it."
set key[id=1108203507015703] name "Now I'll explain the precautions that come with divorce.\nAn uncontested \
    divorce can't be canceled once it goes through, so please decide carefully."
set key[id=1108204107015705] name "Understood.\nOnce the cancellation is complete, a confirmation mail will \
    arrive, so please check it."
set key[id=1108204407015703] name "Your partner hasn't stated their wishes about the forced divorce \
    application.\nThe divorce reconsideration period is still in progress, so please wait."
set key[id=1108204407015704] name "I'd like to cancel the forced divorce application."
set key[id=1108204407015705] name "I'll think about it again."
set key[id=1111144407015703] name "Nice to see you, $MyPCName$. Do you need my help?"
set key[id=1111144407015704] name "I'd like to renew our vows."
set key[id=1111144407015705] name "$MyPCName$, you can only hold a vow renewal once at least 30 days have passed \
    since your wedding.\nYou can't go ahead just yet, so please come back after a little more time has passed. "
set key[id=1111144407015706] name "Nice to see you, $MyPCName$. Do you need help?"
set key[id=1111144407015707] name "I'd like to change my wedding hall reservation."
set key[id=1111144407015709] name "Understood. Then I'll help you change your reservation right away.\nYour \
    partner has to come here and agree to it too before it can be changed, so be sure to call them over. "
set key[id=1111144407015710] name "Yes, first check your reservation details and then make your final \
    decision.\nIf your partner agrees to cancel the reservation, we'll give you a <font color=\"#ffd200\">free \
    reservation coupon for a wedding hall of the same grade</font> later. The coupon is valid for 30 days after \
    you get it, so be sure to use it within that time.\nIf your partner doesn't agree, no free reservation coupon \
    will be given. "
set key[id=1111205007015703] name "What perfect weather for a wedding today!"
set key[id=1111205007015704] name "Good to see you, friends! Gave you a fright, didn't I?"
set key[id=1111205007015705] name "What on earth are you doing here...?"
set key[id=1111205007015706] name "Where is this place?"
set key[id=1111205007015707] name "What am I doing? I'm in charge of the events at the after party, of course!"
set key[id=1111205007015708] name "I squeeze in a little time here and there to dabble in the wedding business as \
    a side job."
set key[id=1111205007015709] name "What, do you want to work under me too? Hahaha!"
set key[id=1111205007015710] name "This is the Ultra Sweet Banquet Hall."
set key[id=1111205007015711] name "That's right. That Rainbow Pinata will play with you all."
set key[id=1111205007015712] name "Good work, warriors!"
set key[id=1111205007015713] name "Is the solution you brought a rainbow snail?"
set key[id=1111205007015714] name "Who was that evil spirit just now?"
set key[id=1111205007015715] name "Just a snail, he says! A true warrior doesn't blame his tools."
set key[id=1111205007015716] name "Back in my day, I beat them all with nothing but a pot lid, hahaha!"
set key[id=1111205007015717] name "Anyway, we won again today, so enjoy yourselves to the fullest!"
set key[id=1111205007015718] name "Hah... That fellow... is the lingering spirit of a sailor who spent so long on \
    ships that he missed his chance to marry."
set key[id=1111205007015719] name "He usually lurks around Lith Harbor, going about ruining weddings."
set key[id=1111205007015720] name "As you saw, he isn't such a bad fellow, so take pity on him."
set key[id=1111210707015721] name "Take pictures with the pinata, and eat and drink all you like!"
set key[id=1112095107015722] name "Now then, shall we really start the party!"
set key[id=1112095107015723] name "Now then, enjoy the party to the fullest!"
set key[id=1118161607015725] name "I'd like to go see $map:84000011$."
set key[id=1118161607015726] name "I'd like to go see $map:84000012$."
set key[id=1118161607015727] name "Ah~ I see. I'm glad you're happy. Happiness is a good thing.\nBy the way, is \
    there anything I can help you with? "
set key[id=1118161607015728] name "I'd like to take the recommended wedding hall tour."
set key[id=1118161607015729] name "Hehe, it seems you want to relive the memories of your happy wedding~\nThen I \
    should help you. Where would you like to go? "
set key[id=1118161607015730] name "I'd like to visit $map:84000013$."
set key[id=1118161607015731] name "I'd like to visit $map:84000014$."
set key[id=1118162007015724] name "It seems you want to relive your beautiful wedding.\nOf course I should help. \
    Where would you like to go? "
set key[id=1118165507015761] name "Nice to see you, $MyPCName$. You look well.\nAre you enjoying married life?"
set key[id=1118165507015762] name "I'm happy."
set key[id=1118165507015763] name "Yes, happy days gather and pile up into beautiful memories.\nBe happy today, \
    tomorrow, and always!"
set key[id=1118165507015764] name "By the way, do you need anything? Is there something I can help with...? "
set key[id=1118165507015765] name "I'd like to take the recommended wedding hall tour."
set key[id=1118170207015832] name "Yes, happiness doubles when it's shared. May you be even happier from now \
    on~!\nIs there anything I can help you with?"
set key[id=1118172607015833] name "You want to look at the splendid wedding halls and recall the wonderful \
    memories of your wedding day.\nThen I should help. Where would you like to go? "
set key[id=1118172607015834] name "I'd like to visit $map:84000015$."
set key[id=1118172607015835] name "I'd like to visit $map:84000016$."
set key[id=1118172607015836] name "I'd like to take the recommended wedding hall tour."
set key[id=1119180007015837] name "Congratulations on your wedding, $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=1119180007015838] name "I'm so glad to be attending your wedding.\nI can't wait to see how happy \
    today's wedding will be."
set key[id=1119180007015839] name "$MyPCName$, how does it feel to be the star of the wedding? Are you very \
    nervous?"
set key[id=1119180007015840] name "What should I do from here?"
set key[id=1119180007015841] name "I'm not nervous at all."
set key[id=1119180007015842] name "Ah, don't worry. That's exactly why I came here, to tell you."
set key[id=1119180007015843] name "How do I start the wedding?"
set key[id=1119180007015844] name "When will we be recognized as a proper married couple?"
set key[id=1119180007015845] name "How do I use the wedding hall reservation gift?"
set key[id=1119180007015846] name "The wedding hall opens 5 minutes before your reserved wedding time and stays \
    open until 30 minutes after.\nWithin that time, both the groom and the bride must enter the wedding hall and \
    tell the <font color=\"#ffd200\">officiant</font> you <font color=\"#ffd200\">are ready to begin the \
    wedding</font>.\nWhen the two of you agree, a wonderful wedding begins."
set key[id=1119180007015847] name "One thing to note: if you don't tell the officiant you want to begin within 30 \
    minutes after your reserved wedding time, the wedding hall closes and everyone who entered is forced out.\nSo \
    both the groom and the bride must be in the wedding hall in time, and talk to the officiant to begin the \
    wedding."
set key[id=1119180007015848] name "Do you have any other questions?"
set key[id=1119180007015849] name "When will we be recognized as a proper married couple?"
set key[id=1119180007015850] name "How do I use the wedding hall reservation gift?"
set key[id=1119180007015851] name "Once the wedding starts, follow the officiant's guidance, write your partner's \
    name, and finish the wedding vows.\nThen the officiant will make the <font color=\"#ffd200\">declaration of \
    marriage</font>, announcing that you two are now husband and wife."
set key[id=1119180007015852] name "At that very moment, you two change from an engaged state to a <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">married state</font>.\nAnd the <font color=\"#ffd200\">wedding completion gift</font> \
    prepared by the wedding hall is sent to the groom and bride by mail.\nFrom then on, you can open the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Marriage menu</font> to check your closeness and the messages you've written to each other."
set key[id=1119180007015853] name "After that, you can hold the after-events.\nUse the gift you received when you \
    reserved the wedding, the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Commemorative Photo Ticket</font>, to take <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">commemorative photos</font> with your guests!"
set key[id=1119180007015854] name "Do you have any other questions?"
set key[id=1119180007015855] name "How do I use the wedding hall reservation gift?"
set key[id=1119180007015856] name "How do I start the wedding?"
set key[id=1119180007015857] name "Once the officiant's <font color=\"#ffd200\">declaration of marriage</font> \
    changes you from engaged to <font color=\"#ffd200\">married</font>, you can hold the after-events from then \
    on.\nUse the gift you received when you reserved the wedding, the <font color=\"#ffd200\">Commemorative Photo \
    Ticket</font>, to move to a place where you can take commemorative photos.\nThe transfer portal stays open for \
    3 minutes, and the photo space stays open for 5 minutes, so please keep that in mind."
set key[id=1119180007015858] name "There, you can freely change the angle as if you were at your own home while \
    taking photos,\nso take <font color=\"#ffd200\">commemorative photos</font> freely with your guests!"
set key[id=1119180007015859] name "Do you have any other questions?"
set key[id=1119180007015860] name "How do I start the wedding?"
set key[id=1119180007015861] name "When will we be recognized as a proper married couple?"
set key[id=1119180007015862] name "Yes, then I'm glad.\nI hope your wedding will be remembered as a happy and \
    joyful memory."
set key[id=1119180007015863] name "Congratulations on your wedding, truly, $MyPCName$.\nBe happy!"
set key[id=1119180007015864] name "Congratulations on your wedding, $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=1119180007015865] name "I'm so glad to be attending your wedding.\nI can't wait to see how happy \
    today's wedding will be."
