set key[id=1120160807015944] name "Do you have any other questions?"
set key[id=1120160807015945] name "How do I hold the after-events?"
set key[id=1120160807015946] name "$MyPCName$, star of the day! You were perfect! I'll give you a round of \
    applause, clap clap clap clap!"
set key[id=1120160807015947] name "How do I hold the after-events?"
set key[id=1120160807015948] name "How do I end the wedding completely?"
set key[id=1120160807015949] name "Use the gift you received when you reserved the wedding, the <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Commemorative Photo Ticket</font>, to move to a place where you can take commemorative \
    photos,\nand use the <font color=\"#ffd200\">After Party Ticket</font> to move to a place where you can play \
    little games with your guests.\nThe transfer portal stays open for 3 minutes, and the photo and after party \
    spaces stay open for up to 5 minutes."
set key[id=1120160807015950] name "There, you can freely change the angle as if you were at your own home while \
    taking photos,\nso have a great time taking <font color=\"#ffd200\">commemorative photos</font> freely with \
    your guests!"
set key[id=1120160807015951] name "Oh, right. You know that people who reserved a Luxury Wedding get a very \
    special gift, don't you?\nBe sure to take out $item:20302962$ from your mailbox and put it on!\nIf you wear it \
    to the after-events, you'll sparkle and shine!"
set key[id=1120160807015952] name "Do you have any other questions~?"
set key[id=1120160807015953] name "How do I end the wedding completely?"
set key[id=1120160807015954] name "After the officiant's <font color=\"#ffd200\">declaration of marriage</font>, \
    you can talk to the officiant at any time and ask to end the wedding completely.\nOnce your partner agrees, \
    the wedding hall will close shortly and everyone inside will be moved out automatically~"
set key[id=1120160807015955] name "Even if it isn't automatic, people can leave the wedding hall through the \
    portal. It should be fine to let the guests do as they like~"
set key[id=1120160807015956] name "Do you have any other questions~?"
set key[id=1120160807015957] name "How do I hold the after-events?"
set key[id=1205093910002284] name "Heh heh, what an interesting power. Shall we turn a crisis into an opportunity? \
    "
set key[id=1205093910002285] name "The fact is, if you inject the power of the rift into a weapon, you can create \
    infinite energy!\nShall we see if there's a weapon that can break its limit?"
set key[id=1211152707015961] name "The unstable, surging power violently pushes me away."
set key[id=1211205207015964] name "<font color=\"#909090\">(...Deep within a strong whirlpool of darkness, a faint \
    blue light flickers.)</font>"
set key[id=1212112607009630] name "Do you want an appraisal?\nShow me the $item:30001025$ you found and I can \
    appraise it for you.\nI do charge a fee, so the results are guaranteed."
set key[id=1212180407015977] name "Heh."
set key[id=1212180407015978] name "Why are you here?\nDidn't you say you were going to confirm the truth?"
set key[id=1212180407015979] name "If you haven't confirmed the truth, go back and do it again."
set key[id=1212180407015980] name "I'll confirm the truth."
set key[id=1212180407015981] name "Heh heh, that's the spirit!"
set key[id=1216165507015983] name "...!!!\n$MyPCName$?!\nWhen did you escape?!!!"
set key[id=1216165507015984] name "?! That's not..."
set key[id=1216165507015985] name "Let's go back to solitary.\nI'll keep it a secret that you escaped."
set key[id=1217160307011985] name "Hello, $MyPCName$!\nThe Tria royal family has prepared special supplies for \
    adventurers.\nThey are <font color=\"#ffd200\">materials to upgrade</font> <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">Gemstones</font> and <font color=\"#ffd200\">Lumistones</font>."
set key[id=1217160307011986] name "If you use the special box the royal family unveiled, you can make upgrade \
    materials for\nGemstones and Lumistones from the <font color=\"#ffd200\">materials you bring</font>!"
set key[id=1217160307011987] name "What materials should I prepare?"
set key[id=1217160307011988] name "I'm curious how such rare materials are made."
set key[id=1217160307011989] name "First, collect <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001187$</font>, which you get by \
    hunting monsters.\nPut them in <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11004215$</font> and <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npcName:11004216$</font> over there to convert the energy,\nand you can get upgrade \
    materials for Gemstones and Lumistones."
set key[id=1217160307011990] name "And you need to prepare one more thing for the energy conversion to \
    succeed.\nTo get <font color=\"#ffd200\">Gemstone</font> upgrade materials, you need <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001188$</font>,\nand to get <font color=\"#ffd200\">Lumistone</font> upgrade \
    materials, you need <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001189$</font>."
set key[id=1217160307011991] name "Where can I get those?"
set key[id=1217160307011992] name "I <font color=\"#ffd200\">sell</font> them. The royal mages and guardian \
    priests\nare making them with great care, so the supply isn't plentiful...\nPlease understand that purchases \
    are limited so every adventurer can get some."
set key[id=1217160307011993] name "Following the orders of $npc:11000075[gender:1]$, $npcName:11000601[gender:1]$ \
    devised a way to convert the energy of the world's monsters\nusing these <font color=\"#ffd200\">two \
    boxes</font>, said to be a gift from a stranger from a faraway world,\nwhich had been sleeping in the royal \
    treasury."
set key[id=1217160307011994] name "These two boxes, <font color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11004215$</font> and <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$npc:11004216$</font>,\nhave the special ability to convert the nature of the energy that \
    matter holds.\n$npc:11000601[gender:1]$ focused on this point.\nCould the power of monsters be converted for \
    adventurers to use?"
set key[id=1217160307011995] name "They concluded that it would be possible if there were no large loss during \
    energy conversion,\nand decided to bind the <font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001187$</font> that hold monsters' \
    energy into a certain structure.\nSince everyone had to be able to use the result, they agreed to make \
    materials that add power to\nGemstones and Lumistones that can be worn on equipment."
set key[id=1217160307011996] name "<font color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001188$</font> and <font \
    color=\"#ffd200\">$item:30001189$</font> serve as structures that let the energy be converted\ninto a nature \
    that fits Gemstones and Lumistones respectively.\nSo, do you understand a little better now?"
set key[id=1217160307011997] name "Tell me which materials to prepare."
set key[id=1217160307012024] name "The Tria royal family has prepared special supplies for adventurers.\nBut... it \
    seems $MyPCName$ can't receive them yet.\nThis time, we're only supporting <font color=\"#ffd200\">adventurers \
    of level 50 or higher</font>.\nI'm sorry, but please come back after you've grown a bit more."
set key[id=1218095907009740] name "What can I do for you?"
set key[id=1218095907009741] name "Please appraise the $item:30001025$."
set key[id=1218095907009742] name "Please appraise the $item:30001025$ for free."
set key[id=1218095907009743] name "I have something to say."
set key[id=1218095907009744] name "I only do free appraisals up to 10 times a day.\nShow me the $item:30001025$ \
    you found and I'll appraise it.\nIf it's a useless key, I can give you scrap price for it."
set key[id=1221144207012029] name "My heart races whenever I see an item with a story behind it."
set key[id=1221144207012030] name "I read a book on the history of Kritias.\nIt said something astonishing."
set key[id=1221144207012031] name "What was written there?"
set key[id=1221144207012032] name "The truth about Kritias!\nIt's a new continent that appeared by traveling back \
    through time.\nIsn't it amazing just to think about~?"
set key[id=1221144207012033] name "They say Kritias has a new power called Ener!"
set key[id=1221144207012034] name "Depending on how it's used, Ener can be warm life energy or cold destructive \
    energy."
set key[id=1221144207012035] name "What matters is the heart of the person using Ener. Whether that person's heart \
    is good or evil decides whether Ener turns out to be helpful or not."
set key[id=1221144207012036] name "They say this land is overflowing with Ener. I really hope that power doesn't \
    fall into the hands of bad people."
set key[id=1221144207012037] name "In short, the heart of the person is what matters."
set key[id=1221144207012038] name "We have to protect this new power!"
set key[id=1221144207012039] name "Do you need something from me?"
set key[id=1221144207012040] name "My heart races whenever I see an item with a story behind it."
set key[id=1221144207012043] name "What can I do for you?"
set key[id=1221144207012044] name "Please appraise the $item:30001025$."
set key[id=1221144207012045] name "Please appraise the $item:30001025$ for free."
set key[id=1221144207012046] name "I have something to say."
set key[id=856579378342002766] name "Says they'll hand over 10 $item:30000181$."
set key[id=856579378342002767] name "Says they'll hand over 100 $item:30000181$."
set key[id=856579378342002768] name "You found $item:30000181$...\nNot only did you protect the safety of Maple \
    World,\nyou've also found a clue to uncover the secrets of the Land of Darkness!"
set key[id=856579378342002769] name "You found $item:30000181$...\nNot only did you protect the safety of Maple \
    World,\nyou've also found a clue to uncover the secrets of the Land of Darkness!"
set key[id=856579378342002770] name "You don't have enough $item:30000181$."
set key[id=4576139967142559831] name "Do you need my help?"
set key[id=4576139967142559832] name "$npcName:11004802[gender:0]$'s research results are truly amazing.\nI wonder \
    if I could be like that someday."
set key[id=5891058498464120910] name "Oh, it's $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=5891058498464120911] name "The Doll Mansion's operating hours?\nUnfortunately, it's still a trial \
    version, so it only runs at set times.\nOn weekdays from 7 PM to 11 PM, and on weekends every day from 4 PM to \
    11 PM, a notice appears at 15 and 45 minutes past the hour, so don't forget to join."
set key[id=5891058498464120913] name "Oh... hello."
set key[id=5891058498464120914] name "I want those dolls. What should I do to get them?"
set key[id=5891058498464120915] name "Oh, it's $MyPCName$!"
set key[id=5891058498464120916] name "The Doctor has given me way too many tasks. My vacation this month is \
    ruined, too."
set key[id=7163785165150355535] name "...\n(There's dark matter here too. Could it be connected to the rampaging \
    golem...?\nLet's hurry back to $map:02000487$.)"
set key[id=8803887082180182094] name "Ugh... What happened? I was definitely in the conference room preparing for \
    the concert..."
set key[id=8803887082180182095] name "Ugh... Uuugh...! Where on earth am I...?"
set key[id=8803887082180182096] name "I... I have to perform... the aria of light and darkness... Heh, hehe..."
set key[id=8921148038777405527] name "Where could it be..."
set key[id=9935710710996664398] name "(Through the blood-red darkness, music and a woman's aria can faintly be \
    heard.)"
set key[id=10540667729495457895] name "(Through the blood-red darkness, music and a woman's aria can faintly be \
    heard.)"
set key[id=10540667729495457897] name "(Through the blood-red darkness, music and a woman's aria can faintly be \
    heard.)"
set key[id=10540667729495457899] name "Where could it be..."
set key[id=15098353941853881629] name "I feel like I just woke from a dream..."

# Quest dialogue of the Event quests (feature Event) that no pack has in English: our own
# English for the 771 scriptquest rows of locale KR (or no locale) whose quest a player can get (83 quests),
# with each row's own format fields, font tags and line breaks; the player's lines are first-person choices.
file Xml/string/kr/scriptquest.xml kms:Xml/string/kr/scriptquest.xml 032f90f7273bbe7d
set key[id=108135814004483] name "Ugh, what on earth has that Black Bean done now?\nDo you know Black Bean, Maple \
    World's biggest troublemaker these days? \nHe made balloons that look like himself and scattered them all over \
    Maple World. "
set key[id=108135814004484] name "Did you know Black Bean balloons only show up on Fridays, Saturdays and Sundays? \
    \nEven Black Bean, who does nothing but play every day, seems to like weekends best. \nOh, and if you find a \
    balloon you get a magic hat, and I hear really good items come out of it, so everyone's going wild!"
set key[id=108135814004485] name "A magic hat with Black Bean's gift inside, I'm so excited!\nEvery Friday, \
    Saturday and Sunday! Want to go look for the Black Bean balloons? "
set key[id=108135814004486] name "Black Bean balloons are scattered all over Maple World. \nYou can only find them \
    on Fridays, Saturdays and Sundays, and you can get up to 10 magic hats from balloons a day, so go find them!"
set key[id=121215822003519] name "Did you get my letter? If you stop by $map:02000115$, please plant a seed. Next \
    week or so, something wonderful is sure to happen."
set key[id=121215822003520] name "Thank you. See you at $map:02000115$ next week. The seed you planted will surely \
    bloom into pretty flowers."
set key[id=121215822003521] name "Did you get my letter? If you stop by $map:02000111$, please plant a seed. Next \
    week or so, something wonderful is sure to happen."
set key[id=121215822003522] name "Thank you. See you at $map:02000111$ next week. I bet pretty flowers will bloom \
    this time too, right?"
set key[id=121215822003523] name "Did you get my letter? If you stop by $map:02000088$, please plant a seed. Next \
